{"id":"acbd9c4756abbc20","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-VF-conservative.md","title":"VF对PA非保守","display":"thm-VF-conservative — VF对PA非保守","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-VF-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-VF-conservative","91-thm-VF-conservative-extension","91-thm-supervaluation-conservative"],"display":"thm-VF-conservative — VF对PA非保守","depends_on":["[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]","[[91-df-proof-theory-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-VF-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-VF-conservative</span><span>91-thm-VF-conservative-extension</span><span>91-thm-supervaluation-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-VF-conservative — VF对PA非保守"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37e8c28d922b32f1\" href=\"?note=37e8c28d922b32f1\" title=\"91-df-proof-theory-truth\">91-df-proof-theory-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-VF-conservative-—-VF-对-PA-非保守\">thm-VF-conservative — VF 对 PA 非保守</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (Cantini 的经典超赋值真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> (一个正算术归纳定义的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 对 PA 的基础语言保守性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathrm{PA}&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathrm{PA}&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>特别地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标签中的 “conservative” 是待检验主张，并非结论。标准的 Cantini VF\n在算术后果上与一个正归纳定义理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 相当，严格强于 PA，\n所以不是 PA 的保守扩张。</p>\n<p>这里的非保守性来自 VF 的整组真理公理、释放原则与扩展语言归纳，\n不能仅由基础语言上的逐句 T-双条件推出。也不应把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\urcorner})\\)</span>\n无前提写成 VF 的公理；具体算术结论必须通过 VF 的声性/归纳论证获得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-VF-conservative-—-VF-对-PA-非保守","text":"thm-VF-conservative — VF 对 PA 非保守","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-proof-theory-truth","status":"resolved","id":"37e8c28d922b32f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-proof-theory-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\n\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\mathrm{PA}<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1747,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["669ee474b9646a38","4a1d989a5f615933","c87db4d1858a0009","37e8c28d922b32f1"]}